[{"text":"ToFCPartialFractionForm[exp, x] converts sums of rational functions of the form \\(n + \\frac{f_1}{[x-r_1]^p_1} + \\frac{f_2}{[x-r_2]^p_2} + \\ldots\\) to FCPartialFractionForm[n, {{f1,x-r1,p1},{f2,x-r2,p2}, ...}, x].","anchor":"tofcpartialfractionform"},{"text":"This facilitates the handling of iterated integrals.","anchor":"tofcpartialfractionform"},{"text":"Overview, FCPartialFractionForm, FromFCPartialFractionForm.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"x/(x + 1) ToFCPartialFractionForm[%, x]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{x}{x+1}\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCPartialFractionForm}\\left(1,\\left( \\begin{array}{cc} \\{x+1,-1\\} & -1 \\\\ \\end{array} \\right),x\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"1/(x^2 + 3) ToFCPartialFractionForm[%, x]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{x^2+3}\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCPartialFractionForm}\\left(0,\\left( \\begin{array}{cc} \\left\\{x-i \\sqrt{3},-1\\right\\} & -\\frac{i}{2 \\sqrt{3}} \\\\ \\left\\{x+i \\sqrt{3},-1\\right\\} & \\frac{i}{2 \\sqrt{3}} \\\\ \\end{array} \\right),x\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"(-64*(-1 + z^2))/(15*(1 + z^2 + z^4)) ToFCPartialFractionForm[%, z]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[-\\frac{64 \\left(z^2-1\\right)}{15 \\left(z^4+z^2+1\\right)}\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{FCPartialFractionForm}\\left(0,\\left( \\begin{array}{cc} \\left\\{z-\\sqrt[3]{-1},-1\\right\\} & -\\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\left\\{z+\\sqrt[3]{-1},-1\\right\\} & \\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\left\\{z-(-1)^{2/3},-1\\right\\} & \\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\left\\{z+(-1)^{2/3},-1\\right\\} & -\\frac{32}{15} \\\\ \\end{array} \\right),z\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"}]